stream
BT /F1 16 Tf 54 748 Td (Definition of equilibrium) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 720 Td () Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 708 Td (A directed-search equilibrium is) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 696 Td (    E = { a2*\(a1\), w*\(a1\), theta\(w\), n\(w\), v\(w\) }) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 684 Td (such that:) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 672 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 660 Td (1. WORKER OPTIMIZATION.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 648 Td (Taking the entire tightness schedule theta\(w\) as given, each worker solves) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 636 Td () Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 624 Td ( \(a2*\(a1\),w*\(a1\)\) in arg max_{a2>=a_bar,w} {) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 612 Td (     u\(R a1-a2\)) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 600 Td (   + beta p\(theta\(w\)\) Delta u\(R a2+w\)) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 588 Td (   + beta [1-p\(theta\(w\)\) Delta] u\(R a2+b\) }.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 576 Td () Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 564 Td (The probability of employment in period 2 is p\(theta\(w\)\)*Delta.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 552 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 540 Td (2. FIRM FREE ENTRY.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 528 Td (Vacancy value in wage submarket w:) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 516 Td (    V\(w\) = -phi + beta Delta q\(theta\(w\)\) \(y_bar-w\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 504 Td () Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 492 Td (Free entry / complementary slackness:) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 480 Td (    phi >= beta Delta q\(theta\(w\)\) \(y_bar-w\),) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 468 Td (    theta\(w\) >= 0,) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 456 Td (    theta\(w\) [phi-beta Delta q\(theta\(w\)\)\(y_bar-w\)] = 0.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 444 Td () Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 432 Td (Hence every active submarket satisfies) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 420 Td (    phi = beta Delta q\(theta\(w\)\) \(y_bar-w\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 408 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 396 Td (3. WORKER-FLOW CONSISTENCY.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 384 Td (    n\(w\) = integral 1{w*\(a1\)=w} dG\(a1\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 372 Td (On a discrete wealth grid: n_j = sum_i mu_i 1{w_i*=w_j}.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 360 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 348 Td (4. VACANCY / TIGHTNESS CONSISTENCY.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 336 Td (    v\(w\) = theta\(w\) n\(w\)     in every active submarket.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 324 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 312 Td (5. MATCHING CONSISTENCY.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 300 Td (    p_w = p\(theta\(w\)\),   q_w = q\(theta\(w\)\) = p\(theta\(w\)\)/theta\(w\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 288 Td () Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 276 Td (There is no asset-market-clearing condition because R is exogenous.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
